# Desolate Lighthouse's "{1}{U}{R}, {T}: Draw a card, then discard a card." needs red (CR 608.2c). Bot1 has
# Mox Sapphire, Mox Jet and Mox Emerald - {U}{B}{G}, three mana but no red - while Mox Ruby is still in hand.
# The activation is refused as short. Casting the Ruby adds its red, and the same activation then draws and
# discards the top Island. Three non-red mana is enough to show the red symbol is required, not merely a third
# mana.

[Bot1 Deck]
Desolate Lighthouse
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Mox Ruby
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

